Package: maxnet-os
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3, xdg-utils, zenity
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | firefox
Maintainer: MaxNet OS contributors
Description: MaxNet-branded Linux Mint desktop integration
 A Cinnamon theme, desktop launchers, and a browser-based MaxNet app
 for accessing the existing MaxNet service from Linux Mint.
